1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,409
Welcome to Use AI the Right Way, a free course from Jerry Development.

2
00:00:05,409 --> 00:00:13,000
In this first lesson you will learn how to stay in control when you work with artificial intelligence.

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,432
AI tools can write, summarize and explain in seconds.

4
00:00:17,432 --> 00:00:23,290
But they can also give an answer that sounds perfect and is completely wrong.

5
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,800
That is why we need simple rules.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:26,941
Rule one.

7
00:00:26,941 --> 00:00:28,341
You are the boss.

8
00:00:28,341 --> 00:00:33,282
Treat AI like a smart assistant, not like a final authority.

9
00:00:33,282 --> 00:00:40,200
If you send it, publish it or sign it, you are responsible, so always read it first.

10
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,299
Rule two.

11
00:00:41,299 --> 00:00:41,998
Be clear.

12
00:00:41,998 --> 00:00:50,384
Tell the AI who you are, what you need, the format you want, and the limits, such as length, tone and level.

13
00:00:50,384 --> 00:00:53,800
Clear instructions give much better answers.

14
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,035
Rule three.

15
00:00:55,035 --> 00:00:56,251
Check the facts.

16
00:00:56,251 --> 00:01:02,251
Verify numbers, dates and names with an official source that you open yourself.

17
00:01:02,251 --> 00:01:06,200
If an answer has no source, do not trust it blindly.

18
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,303
Rule four.

19
00:01:07,303 --> 00:01:08,780
Protect your secrets.

20
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:16,446
Never paste passwords, private keys, wallet recovery phrases or other people's private data into any AI tool.

21
00:01:16,446 --> 00:01:19,400
No real helper will ever ask you for them.

22
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,636
Rule five.

23
00:01:20,636 --> 00:01:21,472
Be honest.

24
00:01:21,472 --> 00:01:24,313
Say when content was made with AI.

25
00:01:24,313 --> 00:01:31,000
Do not copy other people's work, and never use AI to cheat or to mislead people.

26
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:36,081
Use AI to learn faster and work better, not to skip thinking.

27
00:01:36,081 --> 00:01:40,763
In the next lesson you will learn how to write great prompts.

28
00:01:40,763 --> 00:01:44,600
Follow Jerry Development for the full free course.

